# Generic, project-wide rules -- this repo used to share these with a
# sibling project (liveries/) in one monorepo; now standalone, so they live
# here directly instead of a shared root .gitignore.
#
# CAREFUL: in .gitignore a comment at the end of a line is NOT a comment,
# it is part of the pattern. That is why every note goes on its own line.

.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.DS_Store
.env
.claude/settings.local.json

# interpreter path: different on each machine (Mac vs PC), not shared
.claude/launch.json

# The real FlyWire connectome data -- ~50 MB, fetched per machine with
# `python -m engine.fetch_connectome`, never committed. Too heavy for git,
# and it's a third-party download with its own provenance, not this
# project's own work.
engine/data/

# The real flybody anatomical mesh -- ~81 MB across 49 .obj files +
# LICENSE, fetched per machine with `python -m engine.fetch_flybody`,
# same reasoning as engine/data/ above. SOURCE.md (this project's own
# provenance/reasoning doc, a few KB of text) stays tracked.
frontend/assets/flybody/*.obj
frontend/assets/flybody/LICENSE
